# Mental Health AI Project - Complete File Structure Guide

This document provides a comprehensive overview of every file in your Mental Health AI project, including their purposes, classifications (frontend/backend), and package dependencies.

---

## 📊 Project Overview

**Project Type**: Full-Stack Mental Health Analysis Application  
**Architecture**: Python Backend (Flask API) + HTML/CSS/JavaScript Frontend  
**AI Model**: Hybrid Transformer (BERT-based) for Mental Health Classification

---

