### [data_preprocessing.py](file:///c:/Users/SAI/Desktop/Major-project/data_preprocessing.py)
**Type**: Backend - Data Pipeline  
**Purpose**: Cleans and prepares text data for model training

**Key Features**:
- Text cleaning (remove URLs, HTML, special characters)
- Lowercasing and whitespace normalization
- Duplicate removal
- Dataset balancing (10,000 samples per class)
- Train/validation/test splitting (84.5% / 8% / 7.5%)

**Package Dependencies**:
```python
pandas               # DataFrame operations
numpy                # Numerical operations
re                   # Regular expressions
sklearn              # Train-test split, label encoding
```

**Key Classes/Functions**:
- [MentalHealthDataPreprocessor](file:///c:/Users/SAI/Desktop/Major-project/data_preprocessing.py#7-178): Main preprocessing class
- [clean_text()](file:///c:/Users/SAI/Desktop/Major-project/data_preprocessing.py#22-48): Text cleaning pipeline
- [balance_dataset()](file:///c:/Users/SAI/Desktop/Major-project/data_preprocessing.py#75-99): Random downsampling for class balance
- [split_dataset()](file:///c:/Users/SAI/Desktop/Major-project/data_preprocessing.py#115-146): Creates train/val/test splits

