## 🚀 Application Workflow

### 1. **User Opens Application**
- Browser loads [index.html](file:///c:/Users/SAI/Desktop/Major-project/index.html)
- [style.css](file:///c:/Users/SAI/Desktop/Major-project/style.css) applies styling
- [script.js](file:///c:/Users/SAI/Desktop/Major-project/script.js) initializes

### 2. **Backend Connection**
- [script.js](file:///c:/Users/SAI/Desktop/Major-project/script.js) connects to Flask server via Socket.IO
- Creates session via `POST /api/session/create`

### 3. **User Sends Message**
- Text entered in chat interface
- Sent to backend via WebSocket (`send_message` event)

### 4. **Backend Processing**
- [mental_health_api.py](file:///c:/Users/SAI/Desktop/Major-project/mental_health_api.py) receives message
- [hybrid_classifier.py](file:///c:/Users/SAI/Desktop/Major-project/hybrid_classifier.py) analyzes text
- [crisis_detection.py](file:///c:/Users/SAI/Desktop/Major-project/crisis_detection.py) checks for crisis indicators

### 5. **Response Sent**
- Analysis results sent back via WebSocket
- Frontend updates metrics and displays response

