## 🎯 Key Takeaways

1. **Backend**: Python-based with Flask serving REST API and WebSocket endpoints
2. **Frontend**: Vanilla HTML/CSS/JavaScript with Socket.IO and Chart.js
3. **AI Model**: Hybrid BERT architecture with CNN feature extraction
4. **Safety**: Real-time crisis detection with emergency intervention
5. **Data Pipeline**: Automated preprocessing and train/val/test splitting
6. **Explainability**: Multiple techniques (LIME, SHAP, attention visualization)

